---
import Home from "../layouts/home.astro";
import Socials from "../components/ui/socials.astro";
---

<Home>
	<h1>home</h1>
	<p class="page-subtitle">welcome to my page.</p>
	<section class="about-section">
		<div class="intro-section">
			<div class="intro-w-resume">
				<p>hey, i'm shivang.</p>
				<p>
					here's my <span> </span>
					<a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">resume</a>
				</p>
			</div>
			<p>i'm a cs postgrad @ <a class="inst-link" href="https://www.nitw.ac.in/">nitw</a> trying to get better at backend and low level programming. basically, figuring out how things work under the hood while still building stuff people can actually use.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="socials-row">
			<span class="socials-label">here are my socials:</span>
			<Socials />
		</div>

		<div class="intro-section">
			<p>lately i've been spending more time understanding systems, memory, performance, tooling.</p>
			<p>
				i also write <a class="blog-link" href="/notes">technical blogs</a><span> </span>
				whenever i build something or stumble onto something worth sharing.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-section">
			<p>
				if you want to collaborate, discuss ideas, or just point out something i got wrong, shoot me a mail at:<span> </span>
				<a class="email-link" href="mailto:hey@seivarya.in">hey@seivarya.in</a>
			</p>
			<p>
				outside of programming, i'm probably reading random blogs/books, watching <span class="tsoding-link"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/tsoding">tsoding</a></span> or something else.
			</p>
			<p>
				i have a bunch of social links around here somewhere, but i'm not active on most of them. if you want a quick reply, <a class="discord-link" href="https://discord.com/users/1345276369566699530">discord</a> is your best bet.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<style>
		.about-section {
			margin: 0px;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 10px;
		}

		.intro-section {
			margin-top: 20px;
			line-height: 1.7;
			width: 100%;
			margin-bottom: 0px;
		}

		.inst-link {
			border-color: pink;
		}

		.contact-section {
			line-height: 1.7;
			margin-bottom: 20px;
		}

		@media (max-width: 600px) {
			.contact-section {
				margin-bottom: 10px;
			}
		}

		.intro-section p,
		.contact-section p {
			margin: 0 0 15px 0;
		}

		.contact-section p:last-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}

		.intro-w-resume {
			display: flex;
			gap: 10px;
		}

		.resume-icon {
			padding-top: 1.7px;
			width: 24px;
			height: 24px;
			transition: transform 0.2s ease;
		}

		.resume-icon:hover {
			transform: scale(1.1);
		}

		.resume-svg {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			display: block;
		}

		@media (max-width: 600px) {
			.resume-icon {
				width: 16px;
				height: 16px;
				padding-top: 0px;
				transform: translateY(-1.9px) scale(0.94);
			}
		}

		.socials-row {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 14px;
			margin-top: 12px;
			width: 100%;
		}

		.socials-label {
			color: var(--color-text-main);
			white-space: nowrap;
		}

		.contact-section a,
		.contact-section a:visited,
		.contact-section a:active,
		.tsoding-link,
		.tsoding-link:visited,
		.tsoding-link:active {
			text-decoration: none;
			border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
			padding-bottom: 1px;
			font-weight: 500;
			opacity: 0.85;
			transition:
				border-bottom-color 0.25s ease,
				opacity 0.25s ease;
		}

		.contact-section a:hover,
		.contact-section a:focus,
		.tsoding-link:hover,
		.tsoding-link:focus {
			opacity: 1;
		}

		.contact-section .email-link {
			color: var(--color-text-main);
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-link-underline);
		}

		.contact-section .email-link:hover {
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-text-main);
		}

		.tsoding-link {
			color: var(--color-text-main);
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-link-underline);
		}

		.tsoding-link:hover {
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-text-main);
		}

		.contact-section .discord-link {
			color: var(--color-brand-discord);
			border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand-discord) 30%, transparent);
		}

		.contact-section .discord-link:hover {
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-brand-discord);
		}

		.discord-link {
			color: var(--color-brand-discord);
			padding: 0px;
		}

		.icon {
			width: 16px;
			height: 16px;
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			border-radius: 14px;
			cursor: default;
			transition: all 0.25s ease;
		}

		.icon svg {
			width: 28px;
			height: 28px;
			fill: currentColor;
		}

		.discord-container {
			color: var(--color-brand-discord);
		}

		.discord-container svg {
			object-fit: contain;
			transform: scale(1.6);
		}
	</style>
</Home>
